        {
          "description": {
            "type": "root",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "A higher-order component that adds state management to a component for a single prop via\na single event callback."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Applying "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "Changeable"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " to a component will pass two additional props: the current value from state\nand an event callback to invoke when the value changes. By default, the value is passed in the\n"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "value"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " prop and the callback is passed in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "onChange"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " callback but both are configurable\nthrough the HOC config object."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "If "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "value"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " is passed to "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "Changeable"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ", the HOC assumes that the value is managed elsewhere and it\nwill not update its internal state. To set an initial value, use "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "defaultValue"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " instead."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "To update the value from the wrapped component, call "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "onChange"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " with an object containing a\n"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "value"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " member with the new value. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "Changeable"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " will update its internal state and pass the\nupdated value back down to the wrapped component."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "emphasis",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Note:"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " If the "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "prop"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " is overridden, the property names to set the default value and current\nvalue change correspondingly."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
